4298         // ציור פרופיל-צד: גובה-קרקע + גובה-מסלול לפי מרחק — אותו דפוס בדיוק כמו _drawProfileSingle (קו-ראייה)
4299         function _drawBallisticsProfile(canvas, path, terrainProfile) {{
4300             if (!canvas || !path || path.length < 2) return;
4301             canvas.width = canvas.offsetWidth || 260; canvas.height = canvas.offsetHeight || 110;
4302             var ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
4303             var W = canvas.width, H = canvas.height;
4304             var PAD = {{l:40, r:6, t:6, b:18}};
4305             var cW = W - PAD.l - PAD.r, cH = H - PAD.t - PAD.b;
4306             var maxDist = path[path.length - 1].ground_dist || 1;
4307             var minE = Infinity, maxE = -Infinity;
4308             path.forEach(function(p) {{ if (p.alt_msl < minE) minE = p.alt_msl; if (p.alt_msl > maxE) maxE = p.alt_msl; }});
4309             if (terrainProfile) terrainProfile.forEach(function(p) {{
4310                 if (p.ground_alt_msl < minE) minE = p.ground_alt_msl; if (p.ground_alt_msl > maxE) maxE = p.ground_alt_msl;
4311             }});
4312             var eRange = (maxE - minE) || 1;
4313             function xOf(d) {{ return PAD.l + (d / maxDist) * cW; }}
4314             function yOf(v) {{ return PAD.t + cH - (v - minE) / eRange * cH; }}
4315             ctx.fillStyle = '#1e1e2e'; ctx.fillRect(0, 0, W, H);
4316             ctx.fillStyle = '#666'; ctx.font = '9px Arial'; ctx.textAlign = 'right';
4317             for (var s = 0; s <= 2; s++) {{
4318                 var val = minE + eRange * s / 2, y = yOf(val);
4319                 ctx.fillText(Math.round(val) + 'מ', PAD.l - 3, y + 3);
4320                 ctx.strokeStyle = '#2a2a3e'; ctx.lineWidth = 0.5;
4321                 ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(PAD.l, y); ctx.lineTo(PAD.l + cW, y); ctx.stroke();
4322             }}
4323             if (terrainProfile && terrainProfile.length) {{
4324                 ctx.beginPath(); ctx.strokeStyle = '#a6adc8'; ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(166,173,200,0.15)'; ctx.lineWidth = 1.5;
4325                 terrainProfile.forEach(function(p, i) {{
4326                     var x = xOf(p.ground_dist), y = yOf(p.ground_alt_msl);
4327                     if (i === 0) ctx.moveTo(x, y); else ctx.lineTo(x, y);
4328                 }});
4329                 ctx.stroke();
4330                 ctx.lineTo(xOf(terrainProfile[terrainProfile.length - 1].ground_dist), PAD.t + cH);
4331                 ctx.lineTo(xOf(terrainProfile[0].ground_dist), PAD.t + cH); ctx.closePath(); ctx.fill();
4332             }}
4333             ctx.beginPath(); ctx.strokeStyle = '#fab387'; ctx.lineWidth = 2;
4334             path.forEach(function(p, i) {{
4335                 var x = xOf(p.ground_dist), y = yOf(p.alt_msl);
4336                 if (i === 0) ctx.moveTo(x, y); else ctx.lineTo(x, y);
4337             }});
4338             ctx.stroke();
4339         }}
